@startuml deployment
title Chatlas deployment (Docker + long polling)

node "User device" {
  artifact "Telegram Client\n(mobile/desktop/web)" as TgClient
}

node "Telegram Cloud" {
  artifact "Telegram Bot API" as TgAPI
}

node "Server host" {
  node "Docker Engine" as Docker {
    node "chatlas-bot container" {
      artifact "Chatlas Java app\n(Java 21 + Maven)" as App
      artifact ".env / TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN" as Env
      artifact "Logs (stdout/SLF4J)" as Logs
    }
  }
}

TgClient --> TgAPI : send messages/files
App --> TgAPI : getUpdates(long polling)
TgAPI --> App : updates (messages + documents)

App --> Logs : log events
Env --> App : bot token (env var)

@enduml
